    "Source conflict/ambiguity: SKILL.md says to prefer the bundled wrapper unless the repository standardizes on a global install; references/cli.md says to use the wrapper unless the CLI is already installed globally. Both conditions are preserved as constraints; the main workflow uses the bundled wrapper.",
