    "Session isolation is described in references/cli.md and references/workflows.md but not in the core SKILL.md workflow. The IR reads PLAYWRIGHT_CLI_SESSION as an optional context key and preserves session guidance as constraints rather than a mandatory branch.",
    "The CLI configuration file behavior from references/workflows.md is preserved as a constraint; it is not modeled as a separate acquisition because it is internal to the CLI tool."
